WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:25.790
Emergency operation?!

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:13.170
Yes...

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:15.440
Okay, I understand.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:26.100
Shindou-kun's parents will be arriving soon.

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.100
I see.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:31.040
They're not done yet?

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:33.470
It's been way too long.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:38.680
<i>What would you know?!{ep 6}</i>

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:41.730
<i>What would you know about how we feel playing soccer?</i>

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:44.460
<i>When you passed the ball to me in the Eito match...{ep 8}</i>

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.220
<i>I felt like it was telling me...</i>

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:48.780
<i>To face soccer straight-on.</i>

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:49.950
<i>Go!</i>

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.740
<i>I want to play soccer with you.{ep 36}</i>

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:58.690
<i>Forget the revolution and all that.
I just want to kick the ball around with you.</i>

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:01.990
Captain...

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.590
They're done!

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:10.240
Doctor.

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:25.020
Is he...?

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.000
That can't be...

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:32.970
Captain...

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:36.480
Captain!

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:41.790
The operation was a success.

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.240
He'll be all right.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.340
That's great, Tenma.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:50.270
Yeah.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:52.360
A month of rest?

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:57.340
His right leg will need to be in a cast for a while.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:02.090
Meaning he won't be able to play in the finals?

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.360
Unfortunately.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.740
Captain... can't play?

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:12.250
Doctor!

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.460
Isn't there anything you can do?

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:17.580
Our captain's worked so hard to get to this point!

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:20.350
This whole time, so we could get the Holy Road championship...

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:23.860
Please!

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:27.340
Find a way so Captain can play in the finals!

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:30.280
Please, Doctor!{squeak <3}

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:35.390
I'd like to if I <i>could...</i>

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:40.040
Shindou...

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:42.190
Why?

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.840
Why did this have to happen?

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:47.330
He can't play in the finals?

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.810
We got this far because Shindou was here!

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:56.100
But why does he of all people...!

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:01.530
Captain...

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:07.200
Let's put our all into practice today!

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.090
Kurama!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.000
What're you trying to pull by passing it to <i>me</i> , Nishiki?

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:25.990
Tenma, why're you letting them get it?!

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:27.170
Yeah!

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:30.840
Everyone's being sluggish today.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.020
What's with your plays today?!

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:38.190
Is that your soccer?

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.940
Do you really plan to face the finals with that kind of soccer?

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:52.050
It's in!

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:55.090
Seidouzan makes another score!

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:59.750
There's the end of the match!

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:06.850
With overwhelming strength, Seidouzan has won over Senbayama and will proceed to the finals!

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:15.730
That makes the Holy Road finals a match between Raimon and Seidouzan!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:22.600
How will Raimon face up to Seidouzan with its monstrous strength?

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:41.540
I'm heading off!

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:49.930
We have to work hard in Captain's stead.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:53.130
Good morning!

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:54.630
You two are early.

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:55.490
Yes!

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:57.380
Good morning!

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:05.180
Coach Endou!

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:14.830
You all probably know already, but I was out investigating Fifth Sector's training facility for Seeds.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:19.200
I've reported the information I gathered to the resistance base.

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:23.530
Fifth Sector's doings are sure to become clear to us some day.

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:30.080
I'll be joining you all now as we head towards victory.

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:33.420
Then you'll be teaching us soccer again?

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:34.660
Yes.

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.380
Endou will be Raimon's coach starting from today.

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:43.180
And I'll be supporting you as your trainer again.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:47.420
That's what makes Raimon's best formation, after all.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.300
Please take care of us!

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:51.650
Straight to the point, I've got a proposal for you guys.

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:53.030
Proposal?

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:56.290
I heard about Shindou. It's unfortunate.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:08:00.250
But we can't stop here.

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:01.440
Yes.

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:09.060
So I'd like to designate a new captain in Shindou's place for the finals.

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:11.090
A new captain?

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.590
Yeah. The new captain is...

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:17.570
Matsukaze Tenma. You're the captain.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:26.400
M-Me, the captain?

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:29.870
Actually, I met Shindou before I came here.

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:30.980
Shindou?

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.160
Yeah.

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:36.760
We decided that Tenma would be the captain after we talked it out.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:41.290
Tenma, Shindou personally asked for you to take over.

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:43.080
Captain did?

00:08:43.690 --> 00:08:44.930
That sounds good.

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:50.620
It's all thanks to you that we didn't lose sight of what real soccer is.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:55.440
You blew the wind of revolution into all of us.

00:08:56.810 --> 00:08:59.020
I know you can do it.

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:00.150
Right, guys?

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:13.070
Looks like no one objects.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:15.350
But me being a captain is just-

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:18.770
What kind of excuse do you have at a time like this?

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:21.130
Just suck in your gut and decide!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:22.900
But...

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:23.770
Tenma.

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.870
Things will work out, right?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.010
Things will work out.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:34.970
Shinsuke.

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:36.880
Aoi.

00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:42.510
All right, I'll be the captain.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.880
Good, that's the spirit.

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:48.480
Then assemble on the grounds, everyone!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.150
Yes, sir!

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.150
Matsukaze as the new captain, huh.

00:09:54.510 --> 00:09:56.780
If it's him...

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.910
Things will get very interesting.

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:03.740
Inazuma Eleven...

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:04.790
GO!

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:10.200
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:13.700
Listen up, guys.

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:18.400
The coach of Seidouzan Jr. High is Ishido Shuuji himself.

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:22.510
Seidouzan is said to be as good as perfect.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:25.420
To be frank, they have absolutely no weaknesses.

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:27.180
No weaknesses?

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:28.730
Yeah.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:34.760
On top of that, each player is said to have the kick power of an ace striker.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:39.250
Which means every one of them could go for the goal?

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:41.870
They really do sound like an amazing team.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.030
Even in the semi-finals, they overpowered the other team.

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:51.100
But if we all combine our strengths and hit 'em head on, we'll be sure to win.

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:53.000
They're here.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.260
You guys!

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:00.800
You know them?

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:03.320
They're previous club members.

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:07.270
Sangoku-san, we've been watching you guys all this time.

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:11.350
Let us help out too!

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:14.960
Ishikari, Hoshino, everyone...

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:16.960
Ichino.

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:20.440
These guys have something good in 'em too, don't they?

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:23.370
Yes.

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:27.440
We'll split into two teams and do practice matches.

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:29.970
Tenma will lead the team plays.

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:31.030
Yes!

00:11:31.030 --> 00:11:33.720
The new captain Tenma's first command, huh.

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:36.840
Bring it anywhere you like!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.590
Don't hold back!

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:44.800
They've started!

00:11:45.090 --> 00:11:46.140
Go up, Ishikari!

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:50.230
They're up on the offense already.

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:54.940
Risuno, Mohi!

00:11:58.160 --> 00:11:59.440
Kurama-senpai!

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:02.200
Pass? To who?

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.030
Kurama-senpai!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.040
Tenma, give the order faster!

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:09.410
Okay!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.160
Ishikari!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:12.690
You won't get it!

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:16.170
Nice, Kariya!

00:12:16.530 --> 00:12:17.150
Risuno!

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.420
Kariya, pass it to Nishiki-senpai!

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:22.880
What?

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:24.900
Nice, Momoyama!

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:28.050
Tenma, that should've gone left!

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:30.890
Hamano was wide open.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.480
Take a better look at the surroundings.

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:36.650
Okay!

00:12:40.710 --> 00:12:41.550
Nishiki-senpai!

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:43.340
All right, this time it's for good!

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.120
Another cut...

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:50.530
Ichino!

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.370
It's no good.

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:57.950
The teamwork is falling apart because of me.

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:00.250
Matsukaze!

00:13:04.890 --> 00:13:05.810
Ishikari!

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:06.930
Defense!

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:13.600
So close!

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:14.830
Nice shoot!

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:17.450
Yeah, you almost had it!

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:19.030
One more time!

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:37.690
That was a total failure.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:41.340
I'm really not cut out to be a captain.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.260
What're you saying?

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.140
It's still your first day.

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:49.050
It's not like you to get depressed just because it didn't work out completely.

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:52.870
But at this rate, I won't be able to get the team together.

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:55.010
You'll be fine, Tenma.

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:56.550
It'll be better tomorrow.

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:59.180
But I'm the captain!

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.060
I'm so worried.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.440
Hey, what're you doing?

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:12.990
Aoi!

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:14.990
Cheer up!

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:18.340
Cheer up, cheer up!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.960
Hey, quit it!

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:27.620
I said quit!

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:29.310
Wait!

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:34.710
See you, Nii-san. I'll come again.

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:38.230
Tsurugi-kun.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:40.670
You're...

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:42.150
The Holy Emperor wants to see you.

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:53.660
Tsurugi-kun?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:58.660
That's...

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:01.200
Tsurugi and Yuuka-chan?

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.870
I thought I should at least let you know.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:06.630
Thanks, Fuyuppe.{gohan ga..}

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:21.660
Better get ready, we'll get you today for sure.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.860
We won't give up easily!

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:28.820
Take a better look all around, while watching the opponent's movements...

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:34.650
Coach Endou, Tsurugi-kun isn't here.

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:35.710
Tsurugi?

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:41.770
Don't worry, I've already heard about him.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:45.470
Hikaru, take over Tsurugi's forward position.

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:46.090
Yes, sir!

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:50.470
All right! Go, Hikaru!

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.760
Oh dear... Right off the bat?

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:14.160
Do it again.

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:15.310
Yes, sir.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:25.120
Kirino, don't give in!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.710
Kirino-senpai, pass to Kurumada-senpai!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:34.510
Ishikari!

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:43.430
So close!

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:45.110
Good one, Sangoku!

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:46.570
Nice save!

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:53.990
All right, that's all for today's practice.

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:56.600
It's over!

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:59.660
Playing so many matches really tires you out.

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:06.080
Kudou-san.

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:08.890
Yes, it's Endou.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:13.120
Endou, can you come to the resistance base right now?

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:14.970
There's someone I want you to meet.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:18.760
Someone to meet?

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.470
It's been a long time, Endou-kun.

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:27.520
And Kidou-kun.

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:29.090
Hiroto!

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:30.120
Midorikawa!

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:34.940
You know Kiyama succeeded the Kira Financial Group, right?

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:36.940
Of course.

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:41.620
The new company president, Kira Hiroto, has quite the good reputation for efficiency.

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:43.730
Efficiency, eh...

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:48.020
It's all thanks to the support of Midorikawa and the others at Sun Garden.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:51.030
But why are you two here?

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:55.090
These two have been looking into Fifth Sector's financial affairs.

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.010
Financial affairs?

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:02.010
Fifth Sector has been suspected of illegal accounting.

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:05.860
You mean they're committing crimes?

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:06.400
Yeah.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:11.400
Although they're doing it in ways that'll likely never get them caught.

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:14.000
But leave it to us.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.470
We'll get on their tail soon enough.

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:19.840
Heaven's vengeance is slow but sure.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.900
You want to see Shindou-san?

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:27.770
But visiting hours are almost over.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:28.780
Please!

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:39.550
All right.

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:40.890
But just for a little bit.

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:45.260
Come in.

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:46.200
Excuse me.

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:50.710
Tenma?

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:52.230
Is practice over?

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:53.730
Yes.

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:55.510
What's wrong?

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:58.500
Don't just stand there. Come in.

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:00.130
Okay.

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:08.610
It's the finals at last.

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:10.280
Is the team doing well?

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:11.730
Yes.

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:15.250
Sorry it had to come to this.

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:20.830
I wanted to fight with you to the end, but it doesn't look like that'll happen.

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:23.200
I'm sorry!

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:26.290
I'm just not cut out to be the captain!

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:30.530
Someone like me being the captain only messes up the team.

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:34.650
I can't replace you as the captain!

00:19:39.770 --> 00:19:42.660
<i>I want to play to the very end.{ep 2}</i>

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:46.220
<i>If... If I make it to the very end...</i>

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:47.950
<i>I'm sure we'll find a way through!</i>

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:49.670
<i>Please.</i>

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.060
<i>Captain...</i>

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:55.160
<i>Don't give up on soccer.</i>

00:19:55.990 --> 00:19:56.790
<i>Captain!</i>

00:19:57.390 --> 00:19:58.130
<i>Captain!</i>

00:19:58.310 --> 00:19:59.310
<i>Captain!</i>

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:00.190
<i>Captain!</i>

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:02.890
<i>Captain!</i>

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:16.460
Tenma.

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:22.010
You can do it. I know you can.

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:32.210
Captain!

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:39.900
"I know you can do it", huh.

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:44.290
I'll do it.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:49.580
I'll bring everyone together, win the championship, and take back soccer.

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:53.500
H-Huh?

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:57.470
I skipped my street.

00:20:57.470 --> 00:20:58.440
Matsukaze.

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:02.240
Tsurugi!

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:04.530
What happened to you?

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:08.830
Matsukaze, I need you to practice a certain technique with me.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:09.740
Technique?

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:12.330
Fire Tornado Double Drive.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:17.250
It's based off the original Fire Tornado, with even more power as a combo technique.

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:19.460
Fire Tornado?

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:22.660
Isn't that Gouenji-san's hissatsu technique?

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.790
The Holy Road finals.

00:22:55.790 --> 00:22:59.400
With the feelings of the revolution in our chests, we stand upon the field!

